        "explanation": "The caregiver confirms understanding of the red flags, the plan to go to the hand surgery clinic, and that they will not delay the appointment if the patient declines blood tests.",
        "quote": "您说的那四条我已经写在纸上贴手机壳里了，主要就是突然更差、麻木一下扩大、痛得厉害或者夜里痛醒、手发凉变色，这些一出现就直接急诊，不等后天的号。"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00119",
        "explanation": "The caregiver confirms they will proceed with the hand surgery clinic visit even if the patient refuses blood tests, and will report back after the visit.",
        "quote": "他要是真不肯起或者不肯抽，我也按您说的，不拿这个当理由拖后天手外科门诊。我们先这样执行，看完门诊我再来跟您说结果。"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The family provided a clear read-back of the safety net instructions, confirmed the appointment, and committed to a specific plan regardless of the patient's reluctance about blood tests. The closure is safe, executable, and traceable.",
